# Open in an HTTP client that supports .http files and cookie persistence.
# Replace token and IDs with the values returned by your own session.
@base = http://localhost:8081/api
@csrf = paste-session-csrf-token-here
@courseId = paste-course-id-here
@assessmentId = paste-assessment-id-here

### Obtain a session cookie and CSRF token
GET {{base}}/session

### Read the single source of grading boundaries
GET {{base}}/scale

### Create a course
POST {{base}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Software Engineering","code":"CS 240"}

### Add graded work
POST {{base}}/courses/{{courseId}}/assessments
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Assignments","score":80,"weight":40}

### Correct one score
PATCH {{base}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"score":85}

### Inspect the provisional result
GET {{base}}/courses/{{courseId}}/result

### Plan the remaining course weight
GET {{base}}/courses/{{courseId}}/target?score=90
